      "id": "N",
      "name": "Not for publication, restricted for internal use only",
      "description": "Used to denote observations that are restricted for internal use only within organisations. This code may be accompanied with an additional observation-level attribute: CONF_REDIST which defines the secondary recipient(s) to whom the sender allows the primary recipient to forward confidential data."
